.Dd September 12, 2026
.Dt APPSCRIPT-VERIFY 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm appscript-verify
.Nd Verify an AppScript signature
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Fl P
.Ar filename
.Nm
.Fl p Ar public-key
.Ar filename
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a companion tool to
.Xr appscript 1
for verifying AppScript signatures using
.Xr signify 1 Ns "."
.Pp
The options are as follows:
.Pp
.Bl -tag -width xxx
.It Fl P
Print the vendor ID.
.It Fl p Ar public-key
The public key to verify the executable.
.It Ar filename
The executable to be verified.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr appscript 1
.Xr signify 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Jesús Daniel Colmenares Oviedo Aq Mt DtxdF@disroot.org
